eft","material":"steel-desk","role":"ground","tone":0.2,"size":[0.12,0.0155,0.12],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.00775,0.0]},"member":"foot-left","part":"support","anchor":"contact-foot-left"},{"id":"j-r-stage","kind":"box","bone":"stage-right","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.2,"size":[0.0225,0.045,0.045],"transform":{"translation":[0.35,0.0,0.0]},"member":"stage-right","part":"joint"},{"id":"j-r-column","kind":"box","bone":"column-right","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.2,"size":[0.0225,0.045,0.045],"transform":{"translation":[0.3,0.0,0.0]},"member":"column-right","part":"joint"},{"id":"mass-r-foot","kind":"box","bone":"foot-right","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.4,"size":[0.045,0.016,0.045],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.008,0.0]},"member":"foot-right","part":"mass"},{"id":"support-contact-foot-right","kind":"box","bone":"foot-right","material":"steel-desk","role":"ground","tone":0.2,"size":[0.12,0.0155,0.12],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.00775,0.0]},"member":"foot-right","part":"support","anchor":"contact-foot-right"},{"id":"mass-top","kind":"box","bone":"top","material":"particleboard-laminate","role":"detail","tone":0.4,"size":[0.08,0.025,0.08],"transform":{"translation":[0.55,0.0125,0.0]},"member":"top","part":"mass"}],"decisions":[{"en":"1:100 keeps the three nested hollow telescoping tubes per side at their true 64, 54 and 44 mm (4 mm walls) but drops collar, cap, drive mounts, keypad, monitor screen and the chamfers and rounds the plates to plain 16 mm slabs; the laptop stands on 15 mm feet, the U channel keeps 15 mm walls; positions and proportions are those of 1:50.","de":"1:100 behält die drei verschachtelten hohlen Teleskoprohre pro Seite in wahrer Grösse von 64, 54 und 44 mm (4 mm Wand), lässt Kragen, Kappe, Antriebshalter, Bedienfeld, Monitorschirm und die Fasen weg und macht die Platten zu einfachen 16 mm Platten; der Laptop steht auf 15 mm Füssen, die U-Wanne behält 15 mm Wand; Lagen und Proportionen wie bei 1:50."},{"en":"Thermal and structure reference the body solids, except the top board: its outer shell is a real thermal solid cut into strips (16 at 1:50, 8, 4 and 2 at the coarser scales) because the validator judges burial per mesh face and one 1.6 x 0.8 m face would be buried completely by the laptop or the monitor base standing on it; at 1:50 it is nested (laminate outside, board inside, asset layer order corrected to innermost first). Joints are the slide stages between the telescoping parts, the top mass sits at the top centre of mass, supports are contact pads under the feet.","de":"Thermik und Tragwerk verweisen auf die Körper, ausser bei der Platte: ihre äussere Schale ist ein echter Thermikkörper in Streifen (16 bei 1:50, 8, 4 und 2 bei den gröberen Massstäben), weil der Validator die Überdeckung je Netzfläche beurteilt und eine einzige 1,6 x 0,8 m Fläche vom Laptop oder Monitorfuss darauf vollständig überdeckt würde; bei 1:50 ist sie verschachtelt (Beschichtung aussen, Spanplatte innen, Schichtfolge des Assets auf innen zuerst korrigiert). Gelenke sind die Gleitstufen zwischen den Teleskopteilen, die Masse der Platte sitzt im Schwerpunkt, Auflager sind Kontaktflächen unter den Füssen."}]},"200":{"status":"authored","denominator":200,"body":[{"id":"l-plate","kind":"box","bone":"foot-left","material":"steel-desk","role":"body","tone":0.3,"size":[0.5,0.016,0.6],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.008,0.0]}},{"id":"l-sleeve","kind":"box","bone":"foot-left","material":"steel-desk","role":"body","tone":0.28,"size":[0.064,0.388,0.064],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.206,0.0]}},{"id":"l-stage","kind":"box","bone":"stage-left","material":"steel-desk","role":"body","tone":0.42,"size":[0.15,0.054,0.054],"transform":{"translation":[0.425,0.0,0.0]}},{"id":"l-column","kind":"box","bone":"column-left","material":"steel-desk","role":"body","tone":0.55,"size":[0.145,0.044,0.044],"transform":{"translation":[0.3725,0.0,0.0]}},{"id":"l-bracket","kind":"box