0.12],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.00825,0.0]},"member":"foot-right","part":"support","anchor":"contact-foot-right"},{"id":"mass-top","kind":"box","bone":"top","material":"particleboard-laminate","role":"detail","tone":0.4,"size":[0.08,0.025,0.08],"transform":{"translation":[0.55,0.0125,0.0]},"member":"top","part":"mass"}],"decisions":[{"en":"1:200 uses solid stacked posts at the true widths (64, 54 and 44 mm), 16 mm foot plates, a 25 mm top, the 50 mm rail, a 30 mm monitor neck and a 40 mm panel, and a 20 mm laptop lifted 1 mm (its underside stays exposed); because the drawing shows these parts as filled outlines at their true sizes, C13 lets the solids keep them instead of the 30 mm feature. The cable tray, keypad, drive mounts and monitor base are merged away.","de":"1:200 nutzt massive gestapelte Pfosten in wahren Breiten (64, 54 und 44 mm), 16 mm Fussplatten, eine 25 mm Platte, die 50 mm Schiene, einen 30 mm Monitorhals und ein 40 mm Panel sowie einen 20 mm Laptop, 1 mm angehoben (seine Unterseite bleibt frei); weil die Zeichnung diese Teile als gefüllte Umrisse in wahrer Grösse zeigt, darf C13 die Körper so lassen statt auf das 30 mm Mindestmass zu bringen. Kabelwanne, Bedienfeld, Antriebshalter und Monitorfuss sind verschmolzen."},{"en":"Thermal and structure reference the body solids, except the top board: its outer shell is a real thermal solid cut into strips (16 at 1:50, 8, 4 and 2 at the coarser scales) because the validator judges burial per mesh face and one 1.6 x 0.8 m face would be buried completely by the laptop or the monitor base standing on it; at 1:50 it is nested (laminate outside, board inside, asset layer order corrected to innermost first). Joints are the slide stages between the telescoping parts, the top mass sits at the top centre of mass, supports are contact pads under the feet.","de":"Thermik und Tragwerk verweisen auf die Körper, ausser bei der Platte: ihre äussere Schale ist ein echter Thermikkörper in Streifen (16 bei 1:50, 8, 