ember":"foot-left","part":"member"},{"id":"m-l-sleeve","of":"l-sleeve","member":"foot-left","part":"member"},{"id":"m-l-stage","of":"l-stage","member":"stage-left","part":"member"},{"id":"m-l-column","of":"l-column","member":"column-left","part":"member"},{"id":"m-r-plate","of":"r-plate","member":"foot-right","part":"member"},{"id":"m-r-sleeve","of":"r-sleeve","member":"foot-right","part":"member"},{"id":"m-r-stage","of":"r-stage","member":"stage-right","part":"member"},{"id":"m-r-column","of":"r-column","member":"column-right","part":"member"},{"id":"m-top-board","of":"top-board","member":"top","part":"member"},{"id":"m-top-rail","of":"top-rail","member":"top","part":"member"},{"id":"j-l-stage","kind":"box","bone":"stage-left","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.2,"size":[0.0756,0.0756,0.0756],"transform":{"translation":[0.35,0.0,0.0]},"member":"stage-left","part":"joint"},{"id":"j-l-column","kind":"box","bone":"column-left","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.2,"size":[0.0756,0.0756,0.0756],"transform":{"translation":[0.3,0.0,0.0]},"member":"column-left","part":"joint"},{"id":"mass-l-foot","kind":"box","bone":"foot-left","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.4,"size":[0.0756,0.016,0.0756],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.008,0.0]},"member":"foot-left","part":"mass"},{"id":"support-contact-foot-left","kind":"box","bone":"foot-left","material":"steel-desk","role":"ground","tone":0.2,"size":[0.12,0.0165,0.12],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.00825,0.0]},"member":"foot-left","part":"support","anchor":"contact-foot-left"},{"id":"j-r-stage","kind":"box","bone":"stage-right","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.2,"size":[0.0756,0.0756,0.0756],"transform":{"translation":[0.35,0.0,0.0]},"member":"stage-right","part":"joint"},{"id":"j-r-column","kind":"box","bone":"column-right","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.2,"size":[0.0756,0.0756,0.0756],"transform":{"translation":[0.3,0.0,0.0]},"member":"column-right","part":"joint"},{"id":"mass-r-foot","kind":"box","bone":"foot-right","material":"steel-desk","role":"detail","tone":0.4,"size":[0.0756,0.016,0.0756],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.008,0.0]},"member":"foot-right","part":"mass"},{"id":"support-contact-foot-right","kind":"box","bone":"foot-right","material":"steel-desk","role":"ground","tone":0.2,"size":[0.12,0.0165,0.12],"transform":{"translation":[0.0,0.00825,0.0]},"member":"foot-right","part":"support","anchor":"contact-foot-right"},{"id":"mass-top","kind":"box","bone":"top","material":"particleboard-laminate","role":"detail","tone":0.4,"size":[0.0753,0.025,0.0753],"transform":{"translation":[0.55,0.0125,0.0]},"member":"top","part":"mass"}],"decisions":[{"en":"1:500 draws the same true-size parts as filled outlines, merged to the minimum: 16 mm foot plates, three stacked posts per side, the 100 mm drive boxes, a 25 mm top, the 50 mm rail, one 40 mm monitor block (base, neck and panel merged) and the 20 mm laptop; nothing is thickened to the 75 mm feature.","de":"1:500 zeichnet dieselben Teile in wahrer Grösse als gefüllte Umrisse, auf das Minimum verschmolzen: 16 mm Fussplatten, drei gestapelte Pfosten pro Seite, die 100 mm Antriebskästen, eine 25 mm Platte, die 50 mm Schiene, ein 40 mm Monitorblock (Fuss, Hals und Panel verschmolzen) und der 20 mm Laptop; nichts wird auf das 75 mm Mindestmass verdickt."},{"en":"Thermal and structure reference the body solids, except the top board: its outer shell is a real thermal solid cut into strips (16 at 1:50, 8, 4 and 2 at the coarser scales) because the validator judges burial per mesh face and one 1.6 x 0.8 m face would be buried completely by the laptop or the monitor base standing on it; at 1:50 it is nested (laminate outside, board inside, asset layer order corrected to innermost first). Joints are the slide stages between the telescoping parts, the top mass sits at the top centre of mass, supports are contact pads under the feet.","de":"Thermik und Tragwerk verweisen auf die Körper, ausser bei der Platte: ihre äussere Schale ist ein echter Thermikkörper in Streifen (16 bei 1:50, 8, 4 und 2 bei den gröberen Massstäben), weil der Validator die Überdeckung je Netzfläche beurteilt und eine einzige 1,6 x 0,8 m Fläche vom Laptop oder Monitorfuss darauf vollständig überdeckt würde; bei 1:50 ist sie verschachtelt (Beschichtung aussen, Spanplatte innen, Schichtfolge des Assets auf innen zuerst korrigiert). Gelenke sind die Gleitstufen zwischen den Teleskopteilen, die Masse der Platte sitzt im Schwerpunkt, Auflager sind Kontaktflächen unter den Füssen."},{"en":"Minimal: the 1:500 drawing draws the same true-size filled outlines as 1:200 (posts of 44 to 64 mm, foot plates, a 25 mm top and a 50 mm rail stay at their real size, C13), so only the parts that drawing leaves out are gone (the two brackets and the monitor neck) and the monitor becomes one block; nothing else can be merged without changing a drawn outline.","de":"Minimal: die Zeichnung 1:500 zeichnet dieselben maßstäblichen gefüllten Umrisse wie 1:200 (Pfosten von 44 bis 64 mm, Fußplatten, eine 25-mm-Platte und eine 50-mm-Schiene bleiben in wahrer Größe, C13), daher entfallen nur die Teile, die diese Zeichnung auslässt (die zwei Konsolen und der Monitorhals), und der Monitor wird ein Block; mehr lässt sich nicht zusammenfassen, ohne einen gezeichneten Umriss zu ändern."}]}}}